         <div class="message-received">
        <span>Before we share our Dreams - we need to understand what Dreams are. 
        <br/>
        Let’s start with how the BFG holds onto Dreams. 
      <br/>
        Dream Jars. 
 </span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>



<<timed 7s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>I’ve sent over some templates we have here in the Library portal or you can use real jars if you’d like.
</span>
