:: stage2-exercise-dreamJar-b-vn-transcript-eng-ks1 [nobr]
<p>Hello - I’ve found some words in the BFG book about one of the Dreams & Dreams Jars - </p>

<p>Some of these words are the BFG’s own language - Gobblefunk. </p>

<p>
    Dream Jars when filled are colourful and vibrant and Dreams are alive!  <br/>
    Each of them are unique. <br/>
    Discuss the words and then I’ll leave you to design your Dream Jar. 
</p>

<p>Message me the word <span class="codeword-text">COLOURFUL</span> when you are ready for the next part. 
</p>

:: stage2-exercise-dreamJar-b-vn-transcript-eng-ks2  [nobr]
