<p>...</p>
<p>So Dream Jars when filled are colourful and vibrant and Dreams are alive!  Each of them are unique. Discuss the quotes and then I’ll leave you to design yours. </p>
<p>Message me the word <span class="codeword-text">COLOURFUL</span> when you are ready for the next part. 
</p>

