:: stage2-exercise-dreamJar-outro-vn-transcript-eng [nobr]
<p>Thank you for all of your hard work - I’m getting messages from people who are joining the Dream Team from across the UK - all stepping up to the challenge together. It’s incredibly inspiring but making me realise I need to know my stuff. I think what you have been exploring will help though - I’ve got to do some more investigating. </p>

<p>Keep adding to your Dream Jar - maybe you’ll have a dream about flying kites with 2 Pink Hippotamuses both called Denise. Or daydream about what your park would look like if it had the world’s largest water slide in it. Or dream about learning how to make pancakes. Mmmm pancakes. </p>

<p>We all need dreams. </p>

<p>I won’t stand by whilst the BFG, and the UK, is out of them.</p>

