:: stage3-tutorial1-h-vn-transcript-eng [nobr]
<p>Wonderful work Dream Team I’m sure. </p>

<p>I love stories - as I’m sure you have gathered - and so it is brilliant to know that you have created Night-Time Dreams for the BFG to collect. They might be bizarre, silly or mad but that is brilliant - all dreams are unique and we never know what or who they’ll inspire.  </p>

<p>Imagine, one of these Night-Time Dreams could be blown into someone’s bedroom by the BFG’s dream-blower trumpet when they sleep and experience it themselves. I wonder if you have someone who you’d like your dream to be experienced by? </p>

<p>Right, as you have completed the Night-Time Dreams section you have the choice to move onto another section or submit to the BFG. Don’t worry if you can’t do anymore today - continue when you are ready. </p>

<p>Speak soon. </p>



