:: stage3-tutorial2-c-vn-transcript-eng [nobr]

<p>Well done - now the fun part. Let’s daydream about this place!</p>
 
<p>Daydreaming takes place when our brains are given the space to float - much like drinking the BFG’s Frobscottle. </p>

<p>
    Daydreaming can be activated. <br/>
    All you need is a piece of paper and a single pencil. <br/>
    And then we will DOODLE. <br/>
    That’s right, DOODLE. <br/>
    DOODLE just means you get free drawing. <br/>
    Anything you draw is right. Nothing is wrong. <br/>
    It’s all just a DOODLE. <br/>
    I love a DOODLE. <br/>
    I love to say the word too. <br/>
    DOODLE. <br/>
</p>

<p>So, get what you need and then enter the word DOODLE and I’ll give you a prompt to start. </p>


