:: stage3-tutorial3-c-vn-transcript-eng-ks1 [nobr]
<p>OK - you should have shared a Future Dream now. Our dreams for the future change all the time - but great to have one for today. </p>

<p>
    Now, the BFG can leap as he has Giant Feet!<br/>
    Whilst we take steps as we have Human Feet. 
</p>

<p>So, we need a human foot. </p>

<p>Yes - a foot. You can draw around your own - no shoes or socks. Or, if you are worried about too many stinky feet being unleashed, you can use the template I have sent over. </p>


<p>When you have drawn around your foot then let me know by messaging me the word <span class="codeword-text">FOOTSTEP</span>.  </p>

:: stage3-tutorial3-c-vn-transcript-eng-ks2 [nobr]
<p>Excellent work - you’ve worked out some steps that might help you reach your Future Dreams. </p>

<p>Now we can put these together to show the BFG. </p>

<p>
    Now, the BFG can leap as he has Giant Feet<br/>
    Whilst we take steps as we have Human Feet. 
</p>

<p>So, we need a human foot. </p>

<p>Yes - a foot. You can draw around your own - no shoes or socks. Or, if you are worried about too many stinky feet being unleashed, you can use the template I have sent over. </p>

<p>When you have drawn around your foot then let me know by messaging me the word <span class="codeword-text">FOOTSTEP</span>.  </p>

