:: stage3-tutorial3-e [nobr]

<<set $prevPassage to "stage3-tutorial3-d">>
<<set $passage to "stage3-tutorial3-e">>

<<set $nextPassage to "stage3-tutorials-menu">>

<<include "_templateFullScreenChat">>
<<include "choose-messages-language">>

<<run setup.completeTutorial(3)>>

:: stage3-tutorial3-e-messages-eng [nobr]
<<timed 1s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <<voicenote "assets/sound/ping1.mp3" "3s" "stage3-tutorial3-e-vn-transcript-eng">>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>


<<timed 10s>>
    <<append "#chatInputWrapper">>
       <div class="btn-option-wrapper">
      <<button "Dream Team Menu">>
        <<goto $nextPassage>>
        <</button>>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

:: stage3-tutorial3-e-vn-transcript-eng [nobr]
<p>
    You have leapt for your Future Dreams. <br/>
    Or at least planned how to take that first step. <br/>
    It’s hard to say what you want to do so well done for finding something today. <br/>
    It might change tomorrow, that’s ok. <br/>
    Mine changes all the time too. <br/>
    One time I dreamt I was going to be a Zoo Keeper, but now I just want to go to the Zoo! <br/>
    But at least we have made something now that holds our potential Future Dreams. <br/>
    I think the BFG will love to read these and they will inspire others too. <br/>
    So, what next? It’s up to you. You can choose to submit or try another tutorial video? <br/>
    If you want to come back to complete that is A OK. <br/>
</p>

<p>Speak soon. </p>


:: stage3-tutorial3-e-messages-cym [nobr]
