:: stage3-submission-b [nobr]
<<set $prevPassage to "stage3-submission-a">>
<<set $passage to "stage3-submission-b">>
<<set $nextPassage to "stage3-submission-c">>
<<include "_templateVideoChat">>
<<include "choose-messages-language">>


:: stage3-submission-b-messages-eng [nobr]

<<timed 1s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>Time to put your book together. </span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

<<timed 3s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>Teacher, I’ve sent some suggestions on how you might make the book. </span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

<<timed 7s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>Importantly, there’s a front cover to design - unique to your Dream Team Dream Book. I’ve sent over a design but I need you to add to it. </span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

 <<timed 12s>>
    <<replace "#videoWrapper">>
        <div class="picture-container" id="pictureContainer">
      <img src="assets/img/book.png" class="" alt="Book cover"/>
          </div>
    <</replace>>
    <</timed>>

    <<timed 14s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>Then when you are ready to deliver it message me READY </span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>


<<timed 16s>>
    <<append "#chatInputWrapper">>
        /* $codewordsStage3.codeword11 */
      <<include "codeword-chat">>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

:: stage3-submission-b-messages-cym [nobr]

Lorem Ipsum welsh

:: stage3-submission-c [nobr]
<<set $prevPassage to "stage3-submission-b">>
<<set $passage to "stage3-submission-c">>
<<set $nextPassage to $userchoices.landingPage>>
<<include "_templateFullScreenChat">>
<<include "choose-messages-language">>

:: stage3-submission-c-messages-eng [nobr]

<<timed 1s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <<voicenote "assets/sound/ping1.mp3" 
         "3s" 
         "stage3-submission-c-vn-transcript-eng"
         "stage3-submission-c-vn-triggered-content-eng">>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>


<<timed 16s>>
    <<append "#chatInputWrapper">>
        <<button "Finish">> 
        <<timed 1s>>
            <<goto $nextPassage>>
        <</timed>>
        <</button>>
     <</append>>
/* GO BACK TO LANDING  */
   
    <</timed>>

:: stage3-submission-c-vn-transcript-eng [nobr]
<p>You’re ready - amazing news. </p>

<p>I’m getting ready myself -  I’ve been thinking about the Dream Team. I mean do they have a motto? A headquarters? Do they wear hats? Do they all have to drink Frobscottle for breakfast!? It is delicious but it does make you toot.  </p>

<p>Sorry - a bit over excited. I’m so excited to see your Dream Book. 
<br/>
    It seems like it is all coming together now. 
</p>

<p>I think the BFG is going to be so impressed with all of the work we have done. </p>

<p>We are his Dream Team. </p>

<p>I’ll message you when he has come to pick them up!</p>

<p>Until then my friends, Dream Team out.  </p>

